items.MT_Ring_Vampire_Lich.name=Vampire Lich's Ring
items.MT_Ring_Vampire_Lich.description=Taken from the hand of a lich who would not stay dead. It feeds on what you strike and asks nothing in return, until you fall.
items.MT_Ring_Vampire_Lich.lore=Taken from the hand of a lich who would not stay dead. It feeds on what you strike and asks nothing in return, until you fall.
items.MT_Bracer_Thornguard.name=Thornguard
items.MT_Bracer_Thornguard.description=Its iron barbs were grown, not forged. They bite whoever strikes you, and they bite you a little too.
items.MT_Bracer_Thornguard.lore=Its iron barbs were grown, not forged. They bite whoever strikes you, and they bite you a little too.
items.MT_Bracer_Guardian.name=Guardian's Vambrace
items.MT_Bracer_Guardian.description=Worn by the knights who held the gate. Raise your guard and the blow costs you little, and the one who struck it reels.
items.MT_Bracer_Guardian.lore=Worn by the knights who held the gate. Raise your guard and the blow costs you little, and the one who struck it reels.
items.MT_Necklace_Last_Stand.name=Amulet of the Last Stand
items.MT_Necklace_Last_Stand.description=Forged for a captain who swore never to leave the wall. When the wall falls, it keeps that oath for you.
items.MT_Necklace_Last_Stand.lore=Forged for a captain who swore never to leave the wall. When the wall falls, it keeps that oath for you.
items.MT_Ring_Starfall.name=Starfall
items.MT_Ring_Starfall.description=Enamelled with a piece of the night sky. Whoever wears it sees as the stars do, and strikes like a falling one.
