items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawed.name=Flawed Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawed.description=A diamond given a flawed cut. No element powers, and it may carry a weakness to every element. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Fine.name=Fine Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Fine.description=A diamond given a fine cut. All-element resistance; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawless.name=Flawless Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Flawless.description=A diamond given a flawless cut. All-element resistance and crit chance. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Perfect.name=Perfect Diamond
items.MT_Gem_Diamond_Perfect.description=A diamond given a perfect cut. All-element resistance and crit chance; at full strength, with a chance of all-element resistance. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Flawed.name=Flawed Emerald
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Flawed.description=An emerald given a flawed cut. No element powers. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Fine.name=Fine Emerald
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Fine.description=An emerald given a fine cut. Poison resistance; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Flawless.name=Flawless Emerald
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Flawless.description=An emerald given a flawless cut. Poison resistance and Poison on hit. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Perfect.name=Perfect Emerald
items.MT_Gem_Emerald_Perfect.description=An emerald given a perfect cut. Poison resistance and Poison on hit; at full strength, with a chance of Poison damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Flawed.name=Flawed Ruby
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Flawed.description=A ruby given a flawed cut. No element powers, and it may carry a weakness to Ice. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Fine.name=Fine Ruby
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Fine.description=A ruby given a fine cut. Fire resistance; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Flawless.name=Flawless Ruby
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Flawless.description=A ruby given a flawless cut. Fire resistance and Burn on hit. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Perfect.name=Perfect Ruby
items.MT_Gem_Ruby_Perfect.description=A ruby given a perfect cut. Fire resistance and Burn on hit; at full strength, with a chance of Fire damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Flawed.name=Flawed Sapphire
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Flawed.description=A sapphire given a flawed cut. No element powers, and it may carry a weakness to Fire. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Fine.name=Fine Sapphire
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Fine.description=A sapphire given a fine cut. Ice resistance; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Flawless.name=Flawless Sapphire
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Flawless.description=A sapphire given a flawless cut. Ice resistance and Slow on hit. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Perfect.name=Perfect Sapphire
items.MT_Gem_Sapphire_Perfect.description=A sapphire given a perfect cut. Ice resistance and Slow on hit; at full strength, with a chance of Ice damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Flawed.name=Flawed Topaz
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Flawed.description=A topaz given a flawed cut. No element powers. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Fine.name=Fine Topaz
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Fine.description=A topaz given a fine cut. Lightning damage added to hits; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Flawless.name=Flawless Topaz
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Flawless.description=A topaz given a flawless cut. Lightning damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Perfect.name=Perfect Topaz
items.MT_Gem_Topaz_Perfect.description=A topaz given a perfect cut. Lightning damage added to hits; at full strength, with a chance of all-element resistance. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Flawed.name=Flawed Voidstone
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Flawed.description=A voidstone given a flawed cut. No element powers, and it may carry a weakness to every element. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Fine.name=Fine Voidstone
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Fine.description=A voidstone given a fine cut. All-element damage added to hits, but less resistance to every element; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Flawless.name=Flawless Voidstone
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Flawless.description=A voidstone given a flawless cut. All-element damage added to hits, but less resistance to every element. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Perfect.name=Perfect Voidstone
items.MT_Gem_Voidstone_Perfect.description=A voidstone given a perfect cut. All-element damage added to hits, but less resistance to every element; at full strength, with a chance of all-element damage added to hits and crit chance. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Flawed.name=Flawed Zephyr
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Flawed.description=A zephyr given a flawed cut. No element powers. Set in jewelry, it adds 75% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Fine.name=Fine Zephyr
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Fine.description=A zephyr given a fine cut. Wind damage added to hits; at half strength. Set in jewelry, it adds 100% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Flawless.name=Flawless Zephyr
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Flawless.description=A zephyr given a flawless cut. Wind damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 125% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Perfect.name=Perfect Zephyr
items.MT_Gem_Zephyr_Perfect.description=A zephyr given a perfect cut. Wind damage added to hits. Set in jewelry, it adds 150% of the gem's charge, recharges and rune boosts. Right-click to choose the jewelry to set it in.
items.MT_Gem_Cutters_Kit.name=Gem Cutter's Kit
items.MT_Gem_Cutters_Kit.description=Right-click to cut the raw gems you carry. Better cuts come with your gem cutting level; harder gems need a higher level, and a cut at the edge of your skill can shatter the gem. 10 uses.
